            >building the platforms, products, and digital systems that let</span
          >
          <span class="hero__desc-line"
            >businesses across India and the GCC operate at scale.</span
          >
        </p>
        <div class="hero__cta animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay:0.3s">
          <a href="/work" class="hero__pill-link">
            <span class="hero__pill-text">Explore Our Works</span>
            <span class="hero__pill-icon">
              <svg
                width="16"
                height="16"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2.5"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
